---
import ApplicationLayout from '../layouts/ApplicationLayout.astro';
import YouTubeEmbed from '../components/YouTubeEmbed.astro';
import { DOLPHIN_VIDEOS, videoJsonLd } from '../lib/dolphinVideos';

const articleJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "Alfa Laval Centrifuge Reconditioning Standard | What Remanufactured Means",
  "description": "Exactly what every remanufactured Alfa Laval centrifuge from Dolphin receives: inspection, every wear part replaced, balancing, sandblast and two-coat epoxy, a full test run at rated speed, and a 12-month mechanical warranty.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Sanjay Prabhu MSME",
    "jobTitle": "Centrifuge Applications Engineer",
    "worksFor": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Dolphin Centrifuge",
      "url": "https://dolphincentrifuge.com"
    },
    "description": "Leads centrifuge applications engineering at Dolphin Centrifuge, backed by the company's 40+ years of experience in industrial centrifuge systems",
    "url": "https://dolphincentrifuge.com/about-dolphin-centrifuge/",
    "alumniOf": {
      "@type": "CollegeOrUniversity",
      "name": "University of Arkansas",
      "location": "Fayetteville, AR, US"
    },
    "hasCredential": {
      "@type": "EducationalOccupationalCredential",
      "name": "Master of Science in Mechanical Engineering",
      "credentialCategory": "Master's degree",
      "recognizedBy": {
        "@type": "CollegeOrUniversity",
        "name": "University of Arkansas",
        "location": "Fayetteville, AR, US"
      },
      "description": "Master of Science in Mechanical Engineering, University of Arkansas, Fayetteville"
    }
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Dolphin Centrifuge",
    "url": "https://dolphincentrifuge.com"
  },
  "url": "https://dolphincentrifuge.com/centrifuge-reconditioning-standard/",
  "mainEntityOfPage": "https://dolphincentrifuge.com/centrifuge-reconditioning-standard/",
  "about": [
    { "@type": "Brand", "name": "Alfa Laval" },
    { "@type": "Thing", "name": "Alfa Laval centrifuge remanufacturing standard" }
  ]
};

const toc = [
  { id: "standard", label: "What Every Remanufactured Alfa Laval Centrifuge Receives" },
  { id: "testing", label: "Why We Test Every Unit" },
  { id: "test-run-videos", label: "See a test run" },
  { id: "warranty", label: "Warranty & Support" },
];
---

<ApplicationLayout
  hideBottomCTA={true}
  title="Alfa Laval Centrifuge Reconditioning Standard | What Remanufactured Means"
  heroTitle="Our Reconditioning Standard"
  pageTitle="Alfa Laval Centrifuge Reconditioning Standard | What Remanufactured Means"
  description="Exactly what every remanufactured Alfa Laval centrifuge from Dolphin receives: inspection, every wear part replaced, balancing, sandblast and two-coat epoxy, a full test run at rated speed, and a 12-month mechanical warranty."
  heroImage="/images/industrial-disc-centrifuge-repair/disc-stack-centrifuge-repair-at-dolphin-centrifuge.webp"
  heroImageAlt="Dolphin technician reconditioning an Alfa Laval disc stack centrifuge in the Warren, Michigan shop"
  canonicalUrl="https://dolphincentrifuge.com/centrifuge-reconditioning-standard/"
  category="services"
  categoryLabel="Services"
  toc={toc}
  relatedProducts={[
    { label: "Alfa Laval Centrifuges", href: "/alfa-laval-centrifuges/" },
    { label: "Used Alfa Laval Centrifuges for Sale", href: "/used-alfa-laval-centrifuges-for-sale/" },
    { label: "Disc Stack Centrifuge", href: "/disc-stack-centrifuge/" },
  ]}
  relatedApplications={[
    { label: "Industrial Disc Centrifuge Repair", href: "/industrial-disc-centrifuge-repair/" },
    { label: "Industrial Centrifuge Sample Testing", href: "/industrial-centrifuge-sample-testing/" },
  ]}
  jsonLd={[articleJsonLd, videoJsonLd(DOLPHIN_VIDEOS.motorOil), videoJsonLd(DOLPHIN_VIDEOS.pilot)]}
>

  <p>
    A reconditioned centrifuge is only as good as the shop that rebuilds it. Here is exactly what every remanufactured Alfa Laval centrifuge from Dolphin receives - so you know what you are buying, and why these machines run reliably for decades. The machines themselves are listed under <a href="/used-alfa-laval-centrifuges-for-sale/">Alfa Laval centrifuges in stock</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Alfa Laval disc stack and decanter centrifuges are the heart of our business. Dolphin Centrifuge is the independent specialist in Alfa Laval centrifuges, remanufactured machines, turnkey systems, parts, and service, built on 40+ years of Alfa Laval experience and run by a degreed mechanical engineer, Sanjay Prabhu, MSME. Dolphin is an independent remanufacturer and is not affiliated with Alfa Laval.
  </p>

  <h2 id="standard">What Every Remanufactured Alfa Laval Centrifuge Receives</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Bowl and critical rotating components visually inspected for excessive wear</li>
    <li>Every seal, gasket, friction pad, bearing, and fastener replaced - regardless of condition. Exposed fasteners are upgraded to stainless steel, beyond the zinc-plated hardware used as standard (including by Alfa Laval).</li>
    <li>Frame parts sandblasted to bare metal and finished with two coats of durable epoxy</li>
    <li>Rotating assembly vibration-checked; dynamically balanced as needed</li>
    <li>A full test run at rated speed before shipment, on a surrogate fluid (hydraulic oil or water)</li>
    <li>Operational data (running amps, performance) recorded on every unit; a signed Test or FAT report available on request (additional charges may apply)</li>
    <li>Backed by our 12-month mechanical warranty, plus ongoing technical support, available to the original purchaser, for the life of the machine</li>
  </ul>

  <p><em>This describes our general reconditioning standard. It is not a binding specification - actual scope varies by unit condition and is defined in your quote.</em></p>

  <h2 id="testing">Why We Test Every Unit</h2>
  <p>
    Many sellers ship a reconditioned machine without ever running it. We don't. Every remanufactured Alfa Laval centrifuge gets a full test run at rated speed before it leaves our floor - on a surrogate fluid such as hydraulic oil or water - and we record its operational data (running amps and performance). If you need formal documentation, a signed Test or Factory Acceptance Test (FAT) report is available on request. Either way, your machine is run and verified before it ships - not an unknown.
  </p>

  <h2 id="test-run-videos">See a test run</h2>
  <p>Test run videos of Alfa Laval disc stack centrifuges from the Dolphin Centrifuge YouTube channel.</p>
  <YouTubeEmbed id={DOLPHIN_VIDEOS.motorOil.id} title={DOLPHIN_VIDEOS.motorOil.title} caption={DOLPHIN_VIDEOS.motorOil.title} />
  <YouTubeEmbed id={DOLPHIN_VIDEOS.pilot.id} title={DOLPHIN_VIDEOS.pilot.title} caption={DOLPHIN_VIDEOS.pilot.title} />

  <h2 id="warranty">Warranty &amp; Support</h2>
  <p>
    Our remanufactured Alfa Laval centrifuges carry a 12-month mechanical warranty covering defects in parts, materials, and workmanship from the date of delivery, as specified in your formal proposal, plus ongoing technical support available to the original purchaser for the life of the machine. Standard exclusions apply (wear and consumable items such as seals, gaskets, friction material, and bearings). Full warranty terms and conditions are provided in the Warranty &amp; Terms document that accompanies every proposal and governs each sale.
    Call (248) 522-2573 or email sales@dolphincentrifuge.com with any questions.
  </p>

  <p>
    Comparing sellers? <a href="/used-vs-remanufactured-alfa-laval-centrifuge/">Used vs remanufactured: what to ask any seller</a> lists the questions that separate a tested, warrantied machine from an as-is one.
  </p>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="bg-gold/10 border-l-4 border-gold rounded-r-xl p-5 my-8 not-prose">
    <p class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Talk to an Engineer</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-light mb-3">Ready to see what a documented, verified remanufactured centrifuge looks like? Request a quote and an engineer will follow up.</p>
    <a href="/contact-for-alfa-laval-centrifuges/" class="inline-block bg-gold text-navy font-semibold px-5 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-gold/90 transition-colors text-sm">Request a Quote</a>
  </div>

</ApplicationLayout>
